{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115085233400-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115094007\"/><p>黃大仙下邨發生火警。</p><p>黃大仙發生火警。今晨(15日)8時47分，黃大仙下邨龍光樓一單位發生火警，一度傳出爆炸聲。現場濃煙滾滾，攻出走廊，驚動多人報案。消防員接報到場，派出一隊煙帽隊開喉灌救，同時搜救隊到場協助救援。事件中，約50人疏散。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T01:53:32.019196+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T00:52:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T02:07:23.181027+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T01:47:04.419361+00:00","content_hash":"53362200af2a215c5e62aa7b4e29349be8a91eef7621f9975c5b914737ee3191","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}